{
  "$comment": "RUN-01/02/03 deploy preflight contract. Every relation, column and relationship the application requires before it may serve traffic. Checked by scripts/verify-schema-preflight.mjs against the target environment and by tests/polish/phase01/schemaPreflight.test.ts against the generated database types. Add an entry here in the same change as the migration that introduces the dependency; never add a client-side fallback that pretends a missing object is present.",
